      "context": "Category accordion list replaces the long flat catalog. Every category is visible with an enabled-tool count and a disclosure chevron. Enter/Space or click toggles a category; opening one closes the previous. Expanded content uses original CatalogCard, unmodified. No pagination, load more or horizontal carousel. Search matches across all categories, shows matching counts and opens matching groups; clearing search restores the category list. Counts must come from live catalog. Use aria-expanded and aria-controls; keep focus on trigger and do not animate under reduced motion. This is a proposed canvas design, not implemented behavior. DevTools: all twelve categories collapsed by default; source-derived example total 114. Existing encoding cards retained; other expansions bind to their category catalog data.",
