              "id": "ag8VQ",
              "name": "REMOVE → LIST UPDATE + UNDO detail",
              "fill": "$fg-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Remove is separate from the tool link and never opens it. Update local storage and the list/count; announce removal. Undo remains until navigation or another collection action, with no timer. Restore the link and original order on Undo; move focus to its Remove button.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
