                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "PROPOSED MOBILE BEHAVIOR\n390px baseline; 320px uses the same single column with 16px gutters. Keep code at 16px on focus; scroll long lines inside the editor, never the page.\n\nKEYBOARD\nEditors and action stay in normal document flow; no fixed footer over the keyboard. Scroll focused line into view. Tab exits the editor. Dismissing keyboard restores full review space.",
