                      "fill": "$fg-primary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": 400,
                      "content": "Select / extract / delete: real portrait thumbnails, selected count and tap selection; show retained pages before apply. Reorder: drag grip + Move before/after alternative; preserve original page numbers and announce the new order. Use PdfPagesSurface and reorder-pdf-pages/workspace.tsx, not metadata rows.",
