                      "content": "Check task visibility, unbroken layout, wrapping, alignment, contrast, panel boundaries and one primary action. End-user passes: problem fit; novice feasibility; five-second scan; feedback and recovery. Browser checks still required: 320/360/390px, landscape, zoom, keyboard, long strings, RTL, focus and runtime failures.",
