                  "fill": "$success-text"
                },
                "TK55X": {
                  "content": "Private draft r13 saved"
                },
                "dTfwI": {
                  "content": "No live changes. Continue to Input or Review changes. Keep this confirmation inline in the draft status; announce it to assistive technology."
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "mphc9",
          "name": "Coverage boundary",
          "fill": "$fg-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Coverage: these screens own identity, catalog, workbenchMark and every input union branch. Settings, trigger, capabilities, layout, optionsPanel, labels and content belong to the supplied neighboring sections; Definition JSON exposes the same validated data, not a bypass. Identity edits, new channels, engines and executable behavior still need code changes.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "K4U91",
          "name": "Kind selection and accessibility",
          "fill": "$fg-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Kind menu: text selected; files / fields / none disabled for JSON Formatter, each with “Requires a compatible implementation”. Inspect opens the corresponding reference branch without changing the draft. Disabled help remains keyboard reachable. Labels, units, focus rings and inline errors must be linked to controls; long values wrap or scroll inside controls, never at page level.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "S9mDp",
          "name": "Verification scope",
          "fill": "$fg-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Review checklist: direct editable fields; visible save/review actions; current section highlighted; inherited/override labels; locked identity; branch-specific controls; validation and recovery; no clipping. Desktop verification: 1366×768 and 1280×720. Independent ui_validator and end_user_validator runs remain pending: no agent runner is available in this session.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
