              "fill": "$fg-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Each list edits one selected item; Previous / Next select without discarding edits. Add appends and focuses a blank item. Move opens a destination-position picker with Move up / Move down keyboard actions. Remove offers Undo; selected index and count update. Disable boundary actions (first/last and single-item lists) with accessible explanations.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
