            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "i7MGnD",
              "name": "Optional coverage details",
              "fill": "$fg-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "seoTitle and relatedToolIds are proposed draft additions, absent from the shipped JSON Formatter definition. Blank optional fields offer “Use code default”; omission inherits code, [] explicitly clears optional lists. Keep at least one nonblank howToUse step. FAQ uses q/a, not rich text. Preserve other items in all four-item lists.",
