                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "BefkX",
                  "name": "Primary job: configure a tool definition. Select one of the two fields; edit its label, help, choices, default and placement directly. The private preview uses the draft, not the published tool.",
                  "fill": "$fg-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Primary job: configure a tool definition. Select one of the two fields; edit its label, help, choices, default and placement directly. The private preview uses the draft, not the published tool.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "L0qhz",
                  "name": "Operation: key operation; kind select; string values format, minify, validate. Editable labels Format, Minify, Validate; default format. Help: “Format, minify, or only validate the JSON.” Visibility: Always.",
                  "fill": "$fg-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Operation: key operation; kind select; string values format, minify, validate. Editable labels Format, Minify, Validate; default format. Help: “Format, minify, or only validate the JSON.” Visibility: Always.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 13,
