                  "id": "X2RVeM",
                  "name": "Indentation: key indentation; kind select; values \"2\", \"4\", \"tab\". Choose exactly one default. Clicking Set default selects that row and updates the preview. Values and kinds cannot be changed or added outside the deployed contract.",
                  "fill": "$fg-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
