                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "B5TFzy",
                  "name": "All kinds share label, help, pane, span, visibleWhen and a typed default. Selecting a field loads the editor for its deployed kind; there is no unrestricted kind picker.",
                  "fill": "$fg-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "All kinds share label, help, pane, span, visibleWhen and a typed default. Selecting a field loads the editor for its deployed kind; there is no unrestricted kind picker.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "r5b9yP",
                  "name": "text → default, placeholder, maxLength\ntextarea → default, rows\npassword → default, placeholder; never use for secrets (settings persist)\nnumber → default, min, max, step, suffix, leadingIcon (unset / rotate-cw)\nslider → default, required min/max, step, suffix\ntoggle → boolean default",
                  "fill": "$fg-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "text → default, placeholder, maxLength\ntextarea → default, rows\npassword → default, placeholder; never use for secrets (settings persist)\nnumber → default, min, max, step, suffix, leadingIcon (unset / rotate-cw)\nslider → default, required min/max, step, suffix\ntoggle → boolean default",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "vUfDq",
                  "name": "select → label/value choices + default\npreset → choices + detail, aspectRatio, default\ncolor → default + allowTransparent\ndate → ISO date default\nposition → 3×3 position default\npages → all / odd / even / page list + presets\nrows → editable key/value rows + keyLabel/valueLabel\nChoice aspectRatio is also supported for select.",
                  "fill": "$fg-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "select → label/value choices + default\npreset → choices + detail, aspectRatio, default\ncolor → default + allowTransparent\ndate → ISO date default\nposition → 3×3 position default\npages → all / odd / even / page list + presets\nrows → editable key/value rows + keyLabel/valueLabel\nChoice aspectRatio is also supported for select.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "jEoAP",
              "name": "03 / Validation & recovery",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
