                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "E0A3Jh",
                  "name": "03 / Validation & recovery",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "03 / Validation & recovery",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "a4vkH1",
                  "name": "Proposed server gate: reject unknown keys, type changes and unsupported enum values against a versioned deployed contract. Runtime parseSettings fallback is not sufficient publish validation. New behavior still requires implementation code.",
                  "fill": "$fg-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Proposed server gate: reject unknown keys, type changes and unsupported enum values against a versioned deployed contract. Runtime parseSettings fallback is not sufficient publish validation. New behavior still requires implementation code.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "O3Qa8",
                  "name": "Validate defaults by kind; unique choice values; default in choices; finite numeric bounds and positive step; valid dates, colors, page lists and row pairs. Reject unknown or cyclic visibility references. Empty optional controls remove the override; empty required labels show inline errors.",
                  "fill": "$fg-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Validate defaults by kind; unique choice values; default in choices; finite numeric bounds and positive step; valid dates, colors, page lists and row pairs. Reject unknown or cyclic visibility references. Empty optional controls remove the override; empty required labels show inline errors.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "JhX8a",
                  "name": "Example error at default: “Choose an available value: 2, 4 or tab.” Keep edits; block Review changes until corrected. Reset field to live asks for confirmation and restores r12 for this field only.",
                  "fill": "$fg-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Example error at default: “Choose an available value: 2, 4 or tab.” Keep edits; block Review changes until corrected. Reset field to live asks for confirmation and restores r12 for this field only.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "zcMam",
                  "name": "Save draft → private revision, no public changes. Save failure keeps edits with Retry. Version conflict offers reload or comparison before overwrite. Review changes opens the existing review step; publishing is never implied by Save.",
                  "fill": "$fg-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Save draft → private revision, no public changes. Save failure keeps edits with Retry. Version conflict offers reload or comparison before overwrite. Review changes opens the existing review step; publishing is never implied by Save.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
