                  "name": "optionsPanel is optional. Expose title, note, layout (Inherit / grid / stack), collapsible and defaultCollapsed (Inherit / true / false). Enable defaultCollapsed only when collapsible resolves true. Reset group removes its override.",
                  "fill": "$fg-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "optionsPanel is optional. Expose title, note, layout (Inherit / grid / stack), collapsible and defaultCollapsed (Inherit / true / false). Enable defaultCollapsed only when collapsible resolves true. Reset group removes its override.",
