          "id": "yVTbo",
          "name": "Header behavior contract",
          "fill": "$fg-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Primary button runs the selected operation. Chevron opens Repair / Beautify / Minify; choosing one changes the button label without executing. Settings opens its own anchored popover. More keeps examples and recovery together; loading an example or resetting a non-empty editor requires confirmation. Menus are mutually exclusive; outside tap / Escape dismisses and restores focus.",
